# kmscon owns the virtual terminals: autovt@.service points at kmsconvt@.service
# and kmsconvt@tty1.service is enabled explicitly. systemd's own
# 90-systemd.preset enables getty@.service, whose DefaultInstance is tty1, so
# without this file both agetty and kmscon end up owning /dev/tty1. Both units
# set TTYVHangup=yes with Restart=always, so they hang up each other's terminal
# and respawn forever.
#
# This preset must sort before 90-systemd.preset for the rule to win.
disable getty@.service
disable getty@tty1.service
